@startuml
autonumber

actor Student
participant CatalogController
participant CatalogService
participant RegistrationService
participant "offering : CourseOffering" as Offering
participant "enrollment : Enrollment" as Enrollment

== Catalog browsing (US-01 / R1) ==

Student -> CatalogController : browseCatalog(semester)
CatalogController -> CatalogService : getOfferingsForSemester(semester)
CatalogService -> Offering : findBySemester(semester)
Offering --> CatalogService : offerings with code, title, offeringId, availablePlaces
CatalogService --> CatalogController : catalog results
CatalogController --> Student : display course catalog and available places
note over CatalogService, Offering
  Catalog results are a snapshot; viewing them does not reserve a place.
end note

== Registration request (US-02, US-03 / R2-R5) ==

Student -> CatalogController : registerForOffering(studentId, offeringId)
CatalogController -> RegistrationService : registerStudent(studentId, offeringId)

group Atomic registration operation
    note over RegistrationService, Offering
      Final duplicate and capacity checks and Enrollment creation
      happen atomically, so competing requests cannot exceed capacity.
    end note

    RegistrationService -> Offering : checkDuplicate(studentId, offeringId)
    Offering --> RegistrationService : alreadyEnrolled

    RegistrationService -> Offering : checkCurrentAvailability(offeringId)
    Offering --> RegistrationService : currentAvailablePlaces

    alt already enrolled
        RegistrationService --> CatalogController : rejection reason: already enrolled
        CatalogController --> Student : explain already enrolled; enrollment count unchanged

    else course full
        RegistrationService --> CatalogController : rejection reason: course full
        CatalogController --> Student : explain course full; enrollment count unchanged

    else not enrolled and places left
        RegistrationService -> Enrollment : createEnrollment(studentId, offeringId)
        RegistrationService -> Offering : calculateAvailablePlaces()
        Offering --> RegistrationService : updated available places
        RegistrationService --> CatalogController : registration confirmation
        CatalogController --> Student : confirm registration and show available places
    end
end

@enduml
